       'Hello {{ subscriber.first_name | default: "there" }},

I don''t do much with Black Friday. This year I''m using it for one thing: the first step.

Maybe you have been reading these emails for a while and have never made a sound with us. That''s fine. The first sound is the longest.

The workshop is seventy minutes, live on Zoom. It is not singing, and nobody performs. You ask a question your mind can''t answer first, you breathe in, and you let your body make one tone: the tone of what''s there, right now. You don''t need a good voice. You need an honest one.

From today through Monday 30 November, a seat is half price. So is the masterclass, the longer session for people who work with people.


THE WORKSHOP, 50% OFF: EUR 11 instead of EUR 22
Seventy minutes, live on Zoom: an introduction to Somatic Vocal Healing, a somatic warm-up with live piano, guided sounding, and a first tool for everyday life. Your microphone stays off unless you want it on. Replay included.
https://songdance.co/workshop?utm_source=broadcast&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&utm_content=a-new1_text&{{prefill}}#register

THE MASTERCLASS, 50% OFF: EUR 22 instead of EUR 44
A hundred minutes, live on Zoom, for therapists, coaches, bodyworkers, teachers and anyone who holds space. First you feel the practice in your own body. Then how it works, your role while someone sounds, and where it fits in your work.
https://songdance.co/courses/masterclass?utm_source=broadcast&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=bfcm_2026&utm_content=a-new1_text&{{prefill}}#register

(The prices are already on the pages, in your own currency. No code needed.)

With love,
Jacob

P.S. Any date on the page counts, also one in a few weeks. What matters is that you register before Monday night.

--
Three emails about this, the last one on Monday.
Not for you? Unsubscribe: {{ unsubscribe_url }}
Songdance BV, Beaupréstraat 13, 8310 Bruges, Belgium
',
       'html', 'draft', NULL, 'bfcm:known,bfcm:bought,prod_svh_12w,prod_svh_9m'
